review.reviewBody:
Hi!

This was slammin', but I did mess with it:

Sweat garlic, onion, celery in about 1/2 stick of butter;
added flour directly to it to make roux;
de-glazed with a little white wine;
only added 1tbsp of 'Better than Bouillon' chicken soup base; added only 4 egg yolks; hit it with a little oregano. I wouldn't add uncooked rice to this while it simmers, unless you want all of the liquid to be absorbed by the rice. It's best to cook rice separately and chop up a rotisserie chicken on the side.
